song:
1.Poolokaththaare, Yaavarum
  Karththaavil Kalikoorungal;
  Aanandhath Thote Sdhoththiram
  Seluththip Paata Vaarungal.

2.Yekovaa Thaam Meyth Thevane;
  Naam Alla, Avar Srushtiththaar,
  Naam Janam Avar Raajane;
  Naam Mandhai, Avar Meyppanaar.

3.Kempeeriththavar Aalaya
  Prakaarath Thulle Vaarungal;
  Makizhndhu Avar Thivviya
  Nal Naamaththaik Kontaatungal.

4.Karththar Thayaalar, Irakkam
  Avarkku Endrum Ulladhe;
  Avar Anaadhi Saththiyam
  Maaraamal Endrum Nirkume.

1.Naam Theva Sannidhaanaththil Makaa Makizhchchiyaaka
  Vandhaadhi Karththarantaiyil Vanakkanjeyvomaaka.
  Yekovaavukku Nikaraar? Yaavum Nandraakach Cheykiraar;
  Karththaavukke Pukazhchchi!

2.Karththaadhi Karththar Gnaanaththaal Yaavatraiyum Nandraaka
  Srushtiththuth Thittanj Cheydhadhaal,Makaa Vanakkamaaka
  Vin, Man, Katal, Aakaasamum Vitaamal Thudhi Seluththum;
  Karththaavukke Pukazhchchi!

3.Melaana Arpudhangalai Seydhennaip Poorippaakki,
  Enmel Vizhundha Paaraththai Irakkamaai Vilakki
  Ratchiththa Maa Thayaaparar Thudhikku Endrum Paaththirar;
  Karththaavukke Pukazhchchi!

4.Mey Maarkkaththaare, Karththaraith Thudhiththuk Kontirungal;
  Avar Sirandha Naamaththai Enneramum Thozhungal;
  Avar Ellaam Pataiththavar; Karththaadhi Karththaraanavar;
  Karththaavukke Pukazhchchi!

1.Ekopiththuch Cherndhituvom; Karththaavil Aanandhikkavum;
  Visaaram Vittoindhituvom; Kempeerith Thaaraadhikkavum;

  Seyvom! Seyvom!! Sadhyekaraith Thudhi Seyvom!(2)

2.Paraa Paran Mey Vasdhuvaam! Thayaaparar Aantavare;
  Vandhaar Ivvaiyakaththil. Aam! Iratchikka Vallavare.

3.Pisaasin Upaayangalaal Payangara Mosamuntaam;
  Aanaalum Thevaaviyinaal Oththaasaiyum Jeyamumaam.

4.Thariththarame Yaayinum Sandhosham Vitaadhiruppom;
  Maa Kalvi Illaavitinum Oyaamale Sdhoththarippom.

5.Ekopiththup Paatituvom Makorsa Vaanandhaththinaal,
  Sadhyekaraip Potrituvom, Kempeera Sangeedhaththinaal.

1.Sarvaththaiyum Anpaai Kaappaatritum Karththaavai,
  Aneka Nanmaiyaal Aat Konta Nam Piraanai,
  Ippodhu Ekamaai Ellaarum Potruvom;
  Maa Nandri Kooriye, Saashtaangam Pannuvom.

2.Thayaaparaa, Endrum Emmotiruppeeraaka;
  Kataatcham Kaanpiththu Mey Vaazhvai Eeveeraaka;
  Mayangum Velaiyil Nerpaadhai Kaattuveer;
  Immai Marumaiyil Eththeengum Neekkuveer.

3.Vaanaadhi Vaanaththil Endrendrum Arasaalum
  Thiriththuva Theyvaththai, Vinnor Mannor Ellaarum
  Ippodhum Eppodhum Aadhiyir Polave
  Pukazhndhu Sdhoththiram Seluththuvaarkale.

1.Pakdhi Vinayaththutane Panivom Karththarai;
  Avarin Vasanam Kettu, Adhaal Natunguvom;
  Adhaal Natunguvom.

2.Karththaraal Meetkap Pattore! Kalippaaip Paatungal,
  Motchap Pirayaanikale, Muzhakka Mitungal;
  Muzhakka Mitungal.

3.O! Yesu Sirushti Karththaave! Em Jeevan Sukame,
  Umakke Kanam, Makimai,  Endrum Uriyadhu; 
  Endrum Uriyadhu.

1. Karththaave, Indha Neraththil Sameepamaai Irum;
  Ingummutaiya Veettile Prasannamaai Irum.

2.Ingummutaiya Vaarththaiyai Prasanganj Cheykaiyil
  Um Aavi Engal Nenjaththai Nirappak Ketkaiyil;

3.Mandraattaik Kelum, Karththare, Kataatchamaayirum; 
  Mey Anpaal Engal Nenjame Niraiyach Cheydhitum.

4.Ellaaraalum Vin Mannile Pukazhchchi Thudhiyum
  Niththiya Thevareerukke Endrum Untaakavum.

1.Kooti Meetpar Naamaththil Avar Paadham Panivom;
  Yesuvai Inneraththil Kantaanandham Ataivom.

  Aa! Inpa Inpa Aalayam! Nal Meetpar Kirupaasanam
  Kantataivom Tharisanam Inpa Inpa Aalayam!

2.Irantu Moondru Per Ondraaik Kenjum Podhu Varuvaar;
  Vaakkup Polath Thayavaai Aasirvaadham Tharuvaar.

3.Sorpap Peraaik Kootinum Ketpadhellaam Tharuvaar;
  Vaakkuppati Endraikkum Yesu Nammotiruppaar.

4.Vaakkai Nampi Nirkirom,Arul Kannaal Paarume;
  Kaaththuk Kontirukkirom,Valla Aavi! Vaarume.

Aa! Vaarum Naam Ellaarum Kooti,
Makizh Kontaatuvom; - Satrum
Maasillaadha Nam Yesu Naadharai
Vaazhththip Paatuvom

1.Thaarakam Atra Ezhaikal Thazhaikka Naayanaar - Indhadh
  Thaaraniyile Manutavadhaaram Aayinaar;

2.Maa Padhaviyai Izhandhu Variyar Aana Naam; - Ange 
  Maatchi Ura Ventiye, Avar Thaazhchchi Aayinaar;

3.Gnaala Madhil Avarkkinai Nanpar Yaarular; - Paarum 
   Nam Uyirai Meetkave, Avar Tham Uyir Vittaar;

4.Maa Kotidhaana Saavin Valimai Neekkiye - Indha
  Mantalaththi Nindruyirth Thavar Vintalanj Chendraar;

5. Paavikatkaaip Paranitam Parindhu Ventiye - Avar 
  Patcham Vaiththuram Thozhumparai Ratchai Seykiraar;

1.Karththaave Ummantai Vandhom Aaseervaadham Thaarum; 
  Um Aalayam Vitteku Mun Samaadhaanam Thaarum.

2.Karththaave, Veetu Selkirom Engalotu Vaarum;
 Amaidhiyaai Aikkiyamaai Vazhi Ekach Cheyyum.

1.Ennotirum, En Nesa Karththare,
  Velichcham Mangi Iruttaayitre;
  Matror Oththaasai Atrup Poyinum
  Neer Meych Chakaayare, Ennotirum.

2.Neer Mele Kumizh Pol En Aayusum
  Immaiyin Inpa Vaazhvum Neengitum;
  Kankanta Yaavum Maarip Poyinum,
  Maaraadha Karththare, Ennotirum.

3.Neer Koota Nindru Thaangi Vaarume,
  Appodhu Theemaikku Naan Thappuven;
  Neer En Thunai En Paadhai Kaattiyum
  En Inpa Thunpaththil Ennotirum.

4.Naan Anjiten Neer Kootath Thanginaal;
  En Klesam Maarum Um Prasannaththaal;
  Saave, Enge Un Koorum Jeyamum?
  Endraara Vaarippen Ennotirum.

1. Soozhum Irulil, Arul Jodhiye, Nataththume;
  Raavum Irul, En Veetun Thoorame, Nataththume;
  Neer Thaangin, Thoorak Kaatchi Aasiyen;
  Or Ati Mattung Kaanak Ketkiren.

2. En Ishtappati Natandhen, Aiyo! Munnaalilum
  Oththaasai Thetavillai, Ippodho Neer Nataththum;
  Ullaasam Naati, Thikil Nerinum,
  Veempu Konten; Adhai Ennaadheyum.

3. Im Mattun Thaangi Vandha Neer Innum Iraap Pomattum.
  Kanmalai, Seru, Kaatu, Aatrilum Nataththitum;
  Udhaya Neram Varak Kalippen 
  Maraindhu Pona Nesaraik Kaanpen.

1. Karththaave, Naangal Nenjaththil Meynj Gnaanamatra Maandhar;
  Neer Puththiyaith Tharaavitin Eppodhum Puththiyeenar;
  Ummaal Untaana Vedhaththaal, Um Aaviyin Sakaayaththaal,
  Nar Paadhai Kaana Ventum.

2. Vedhaththukkaaka Thoththiram Umakkuntaavadhaaka;
  Um Thiru Vaarththaiyaith Thinam Ellaarum Pakdhiyaaka
  Vaasiththu, Kettu, Sindhiththu, Utkolla Neer Kataatchiththu,
  Nallaavi Niththam Eeyum.

3. Pidhaave! Engum Jeevanaam Um Vaarththai Selvadhaaka;
  Aa! Yesuve, Neer Sendradhaam Senneri Selvomaaka,
  Nallaaviyai Em Ullaththil Irakki Vaarththaiyaal Adhil
  Narseer Aliththuk Kaarum.

1. Raajan Thaaveedhoorilulla Maattukkottil Ondrile,
  Kanni Maadhaa Paalan Thannai Munnanaiyil Vaiththaare;
  Maadhaa Mariyammaal Thaan Paalan Yesukirisdhudhaan.

2. Thevanaal Anuppappatta Ulaka Ratchakar Thaam
  Avar Veeto Maattuk Kottil, Thottilo Munnanaiyaam
  Ezhaiyotu Ezhaiyaai Vaazhndhaar Poovil Thaazhmaiyaai.

3. Saandhamulla Kanni Kaiyil Paalanaakath Thoonginaar;
  Tham Maadhaavai Nokkip Paarththu,Nesaththotu Valarndhaar;
  Avar Pol Keezhppativom; Saandhaththotu Natappom.

4. Paalark Ketra Paadhai Kaattap Paalanaaka Valarndhaar;
  Palaveena Maandhan Polath Thunpam, Thukkam Sakiththaar;
  Inpa Thunpa Naalilum Thunai Seyvaar Namakkum.

5. Nammai Meetta Nesar Thammaik Kannaal Kantukalippom;
  Avar Thaame Nidhya Raajya Naadhar Endru Arivom;
  Paalarai Anpaakave Thammitaththil Serppaare.

6. Maattuth Thozhuvaththil Alla; Raaja Aasanaththilum,
  Ezhaik Kolamaaka Alla,Raaja Kreetanj Chootiyum
  Ratchakar Veetriruppaar; Paalar Soozhndhu Potruvaar.

1. O Pedhlakeme Sitroore, Enne Un Amaidhi!
  Ayarndhe Niththirai Seykaiyil Oorndhitum Vaanvelli
  Vin Vaazhvin Jodhi Thondritre Un Veedhiyil Indre;
  Nallor Naattam Pollaar Kottam Un Paalan Yesuve.

2. Koorum, O Viti Vellikaal! Immaindhan Janmame;
  Vinvendharkku Makimaiye, Paaril Amaidhiyaam;
  Maa Thivviya Paalan Thondrinaar Manmaandhar Thookkaththil,
  Vizhiththirukka Thoodharum Anpotu Vaanaththil.

3. Amaidhiyaai Amaidhiyaai Vin Eevu Thondrinaar;
  Maandharkku Svaami Aasiyum Amaidhiyaai Eevaar;
  Kelaadhe Avar Varukai Ippaava Lokaththil
  Mey Pakdhar Erpaar Svaamiyai Tham Saandha Aanmaavil.

4. Venta Nar Siru Paalarum Ith Thooya Paalanai,
  Azhaikka Ezhai Maandharum Ikkanni Maindhanai,
  Visvaasamum Nam Paasamum Varavaip Paarkkave,
  Iraavai Neekkith Thondruvaar Immaatchi Paalane.

5. Pedhlem Thooya Paalane, Irangi Varuveer;
  Jenippeer Engalil Indrum Em Paavam Neekkuveer;
  Narseydhi Ivvizhaa Thannil Isaippaar Thoodhare;
  Aa Vaarum, Vandhu Thangitum Immaanu Velare.

Iraththam Sindhi Nammai Yavar
Muththi Serkkap Pirandhaar.

Niththam Avarotu Vaazhach Chadhya Vazhi Thirandhaar;
Karththare Tham Pakdhar Paavam Marandhaar.			- Iraththam

1. Mosaththuk Kullaana Ennai Yesu Suvaami Paarththaar;
  Naasaththirun Thoti Vandha Neesanaiye Serththaar; 
  Nesa Meetpar Paasamaakak Kaaththaar				- Iraththam

2. Kenji Vandha Paavikatkaaith Thanjamaaka Nindraar;
  Minji Mosanj Cheyyu Mandha Vanjappeyaik Kondraar;
  Konjamume Anjitaamal Vendraar. 					- Iraththam

3. Ponnulakath Thinpangalai Ennullaththil Thandhaar;
  Thannutan Nar Pangu Pera Mannar En Mel Ukandhaar:
  Sinnappata Innilaththil Vandhaar.					- Iraththam

4. Thunpam Varum Velaiyinil Inpame Kontaatuvom, 
Thampiraanum En Mel Vaiththa Anpin Nesam Paatuvom,
Amparaththil Nanparutan Kootuvom. 				- Iraththam

1. Nal Meetpar Iyesu Naamame En Kaadhukkinpamaam;
  Punpatta Nenjai Aatrave Ootrunta Thailamaai.

2. Annaamam Naindha Aaviyai Nandraakath Thetrume;
  Thukkaththaal Thoindha Ullaththaith Thitappatuththume.

3. Pasiththa Aaththumaavukku Mannaavaip Polaakum;
  Ilaiththuppona Aavikku Aarokyam Thandhitum.

4. En Ratchakaa, En Ketakam En Kottaiyum Neere;
  Niraindha Arul Pokkisham, Anaiththum Neerdhaame.

5. Maanesar, Meyppar, Parththaavum; En Jeevanum Neere;
  En Theerkkarum, En Raajaavum Aasaariyarume.

6. En Nenjin Ookkam Arpandhaan, En Anpil Kulirndhen;
  Um Mukam Paarkkum Podho, Naan Seeraakap Potruven.

7. Immaiyil Aayul Muzhudhum Um Anpaik Kooruven;
  Um Naamaththaal En Saavilum Naan Aarith Theruven.

1. Jeevaadhipadhi, Jodhiye,
  Pakdharin Inpa Yesuve
  Lokin Maa Inpam Rusiththum
  Serndhom Um Paadhame Meentum.

2. Paadham Serndhorai Meetpeere;
  Ivvunmai Endrum Maaraadhe;
  Thetuvorkkuch Neer Nallavar;
  Patruvorkkuch Champooranar;

3. Vin Appam Ummil Rusippom,
  Mutrum Utkolla Aasippom;
  Neer Jeeva Ootru Ummile
  Ullaththin Thaakam Theerume.

4. Maaritum Vaazhkkai Yaavilum
  Em Aadhmaa Ummai Vaanjikkum;
  Um Arut Paarvai Inpame,
 Visvaasipporkkup Paakyame.

5. Thangum Emmotu, Yesuve,
  Ekkaalum Aatrith Thetrume;
  Kaarirul Paavam Ottume,
  Um Thooya Jodhi Veesume.

1. Iraththam Kaayam Kuththum Niraindhu,  Nindhaikke 
  Mul Kireetaththaale Sutrum Sootunta Sirase, 
  Mun Kana Menmai Konta Nee Lachchai Kaanpaanen?
  Aiyo, Vadhaindhu Nondha Ummun Panikiren.

2. Neer Patta Vaadhai Yaavum En Paavap Paarame; 
  Iththeengum Novum Saavum En Kutram Karththare 
  Idho, Naan Endrunjaaka Nerasdhan Enkiren;
  Aanaalum Neer Anpaaka Ennaik Kannokku Men.

3. Neer Ennai Umadhaataai Ariyum Meyppare; 
  Mun Jeevan Oorum Aaraai En Thaakam Theerththeere; 
  Neer Ennaip Podhippikka Amirdham Untene;
  Neer Thetraravalikka Perinpa Maayitre.

4. Ummantai Inge Nirpen, En Mel Irangumen;
  Vinnappaththil Tharippen, En Karththarai Viten;
  Idho, Naan Ummaip Patri Kanneer Vittantinen;
  Marikka Ummaik Katti Anaiththuk Kolluven.

5. En Ezhai Manadhukku Neer Paatupattadhe
  Makaa Sandhoshaththukku Palikkum, Meetpare
  En Jeevane, Naan Koora Ichchiluvaiyile
  Ummoten Kannai Mooti Mariththaal Nanmaiye.

6. Naan Ummaith Thaazhmaiyaaka Vanangi Niththame
  Neer Patta Kasdhikkaaka Thudhippen, Iyesuve;
  Naan Ummil Oondri Nirka Sakaayaraayirum;
  Naan Ummile Marikka Kataatchiththarulum.

7. En Moochchotungum Andha Katai Ikkattilum
  Neer Enakkaai Irandha Roopamaakak Kaanpiyum;
  Appo Naan Ummaip Paarththu Kannokki Nenjile
  Anaiththuk Kontu Saaindhu Thoonguven, Iyesuve.

1. Theyvaattuk Kuttikkup Panmuti Soottitum;
  Innisaiyaaip Perosaiyaai Vin Keedham Muzhangum;
  Ullame Potritu, Unakkaai Maantaaraam;
  Sadhaakaalamum Avare Oppatra Vendharaam.

2. Anpaarndha Karththarukkup Panmuti Soottitum;
  Kaikaal Vilaavin Kaayangal   Vinnilum Vilangum.
  Paarpparo Thoodharum Eritta Kaayangal?
  Panivare Saashtaangamaai Mootuvar Tham Kankal.

3. Samaadhaanak Karththar! Panmuti Soottitum;
  Por Oindhu Jepa Sdhoththirame Poomiyai Nirappum;
  Aalvaar Endrendraikkum; Aalum Evvitamum
  Vinloka Paakkiyach Chirappu Vilangi Valarum.

4. Aantaantum Aalvorkkup Panmuti Soottitum;
  Saraasarangal Sirushtiththor Unnadha Theyvamum;
  Paavikkaai Aaruyir Eendha En Meetpare,
  Sadhaa Niththiya Kaalamaai Umakkuth Thudhiye.

1. Thitam En Nenjame, Kutra Payam Neekku;
  Iraththap Paliye Un Padhilaai Nokku;
  Aasanamun Meetpar Nirpaar,
  En Per Tham Kaiyir Padhiththaar.

2. Endrum  Mer Jeevippaar, Enakkaai Jepikka
  Sarvam Meetkum Nesar, Tham Iraththam Koora;
  Maandhar Meetpin Avviraththam,
  Thelippaar Kirupaasanam.

3. Senneerk Kaayam Aindhum Kalvaari Thotrume;
  Avai Pelach Chepam Enakkaai Ootrume;
  "Avanai Manniyum Endrum
  Paavi Saaka Vitaadhirum"!

4. Pidhaa Anpaaik Ketpaar Apishekan Jepam;
  Avar Thalla Maattaar Tham Maindhar Samookam;
  Iraththam Aaviyum Ondraai
  Sollum "Needhevir Pirandhaar".

1. Vaarum Yesu Naadhaa Vaarum;  Pakdhar Kaaththu Nirkiraar;
  Kaatu Pondra Lokil, Paarum, Kashta Yaadhrai Seykiraar;
  Ummaik Kaana (2) Aaval Kontu Selkindraar.

2. Sarva Sishti Ekamaaka Kaaththuth Thavikkindradhe;
  Meetpu Thondra Aavalaaka Edhir Nokku Kindradhe;
  Neer Vandhaalo, (2) Poomi Sezhiththongume.

3. Vaarum, Yesu Naadhaa Vaarum; Vaanam Poomi Aaluveer;
  Ummai Nampino Rellaarum Vaazhvu Kaanach Cheykuveer.
  Peraanandham (2) Thandhu Poorippaakkuveer.

1. Neer Vaarum Karththaave; Raakkaalam Sendru Pom;
  Maa Arunodhayam Kaanave Aanandham Aakuvom.

2. Neer Vaarum, Pakdharkal Kalaiththuk Sorkindraar;
  Nallaavi Manavaattiyum Neer Vaarum Enkiraar.

3. Neer Vaarum, Sirushtiyum Thaan Patum Thunpaththaal
  Ekopith Thengi Aavalaaith Thaviththu Nirpadhaal.

4. Neer Vaarum, Aantavaa; Maatraaraich Chandhippeer;
  Iruppuk Kolaal Thantiththudh Keezhaakkip Potuveer.

5. Neer Vaarum Yesuve, Payir Mudhirndhadhe,
  Um Arivaalai Neettume, Maa Needhiparare.

6. Neer Vaarum, Raajaave; Per Vaazhvai Naattuveer;
  Paazhaana Poomi Mutrilum Neer Pudhidhaakkuveer.

7. Neer Vaarum, Raajaave; Poolokam Aaluveer;
  Neengaadha Samaadhaanaththin Sengol Seluththuveer.

1. Mey Raajaa Krisdhu Naadhar Maa Thayai Kaattavum
  Santaala Maandharaale Thallunta Podhilum
  Vandharasaalung Kaalam Sameepa Maayitre!
  Raajareeka Nalla Kaalam Varume!

  Raajareeka Nalla Kaalam Sameepamaayitre!
  Yesu Maatchi Menmaiyotu Prasannamaakave
  Jodhik Kaatchi Kantu, Pooththa Kan Yaavum Kulirum;
  Raajareeka Nalla Kaalam Varattum!

2. Vin Jodhi Oli Veesa, Mey Theva Pakdharum
  Kempeera Kolaththotu Kontaattanj Cheyyavum,
  Nalmeetpar Maanpaip Paarththu Kan Yaavum Kulirum;
  Raajareeka Nalla Kaalam Varattum!

3. Eppaatum Novum Indri Aanandham Ataivom;
  Maasatra Nenjaththotu Oyaamal Potruvom;
  Maa Raaja Sannidhaanam Nindraatchi Seyyavum;
  Raajareeka Nalla Kaalam Varattum!

4. Per Vaazhvin Kaalam Vara Prayaasappatuvom.
  Nanneri Thavaraamal Munsendru Theruvom;
  Theeyorum Kunam Maara Eppodhum Muyalvom;
  Raajareeka Nalla Kaalam Nokkuvom!

1. Varuvaare! Thaaveedhin Maindhar Vetri Vendhanaanaar;
  Vaana Mekangal Meedhu Vandhu Arasaatchi Seyvaar.

  Allelooyaa! (2) Varave Varuvaar!
  Thaasar Yaavarum Putaisoozha Raajareekam Seyvaar.

2. Varuvaare, Thayaala Meetpar, Paatu Pattavare;
  Sarva Maatchimai Menmaiyotum Aaluvaar Endrume.

3. Varuvaare! Makaadhikaaran Raajaa! Vaazhka! Enpom;
  Arul Jodhi Prakaasam Veesa, Potri Vananguvom.

4. Varuvaare! Sapaadhipadhi, Pakdhar Yaavaiyum
  Naanaa Thisai Yinindru Koottich Cherththu Vaazhvikkavum.

1. Mesiyaa Idho Sameepam! Endror Saththang Kelungal;
  Velichchaththin Pillaikale, Raavin Kanaa Neekkungal.

2. Iv Vech Charippaal Vizhiththu, Loka Paasam Vitungal;
  Paava Naasar Mesiyaavin Varukaiyaip Paarungal.

3. Edhir Paarththa Kirisdhu Naadhar Mannippeeya Vandhaare;
  Andha Mannippai Ataiya Kanneerotu Servome.

4. Maatchiyotu Varumpodhu Paarilullor Anjuvaar;
  Avar Anpaang Ketakaththaal Thaasar Thammai Maraippaar.

5. Theva Sudhan Makaa Raajaa, Ulakin Ratchakarkke;
  Kanam, Palam, Maatchi, Pukazh Nidhya Kaalam Aakave.

1. Yesu Maa Raajar Thaam Idho, Vaasal Aruke Nirkiraar;
   Naam Ninaiyaadha Velaiyil Raajaa Varuvaare.

   Varuvaar, Varuvaar, Oruvarum Ariyaa Neram
   Yesu Raajaa, Makaa Raajaa, Vaiyakam Varuvaare.

2. Pantaith Theerkkar Sollippona Ataiyaalangal Palavum
  Nataiperukindrana Paar, Itaiyaraamale. 			- Varuvaar

3. Needhi Sooriyan Udhikka Neram Pitikkaadhu Ini;
  Vaanam Veli Vaangudhu Paar, Paar, Paar Vitiyudhu. 	- Varuvaar

4. Niththirai Vittezhundhu Nee Raththaththaal Ullam Kazhuvi;
  Saththiya Aatai Thariththu, Karththaraich Chandhi Vaa. 	- Varuvaar

Enadhu Karththarin Raajareeka Naal Eppo Varukumo?
Engum En Kali Neengi Makizhchchi
Eppo Perukumo? Engum En Kali 
Neengi Makizhchchi Eppo Perukumo?

1. Manidha Sudhanin Ataiyaalam Vinnil Kaanum Endraare;
  Vallamaiyotu Makimaiyaaith Thondri Varuven Endraare,       		- Enadhu

2. Theva Thoodharin Kataisi Ekkaalath Thoni Muzhangave;
  Jekaththil Pakdharkal Karththaritaththuk Kezhundhu Pokave      	- Enadhu

3. Jekaththil Yesuvaip Patri Mariththor Uyirth Thezhumpave;
  Jeevanullorum Avarutan Maru Roopamaakave          			- Enadhu

4. Paava Manushan, Sonnaarpola Thondri Vittaane;
  Parisuththa Manu Jaadhi Vedhanai Ataindhum Vittadhe  			- Enadhu

5. Ataiyaalam Pala Kaanum Enach Chonnaar Polave;
  Arivu Peruki Angu Mingum Otukindranare          				- Enadhu

6. Paavam Peruka Palar Visvaasam Kuraindhu Pokudhe;
  Payangal, Panjam, Yuththangal, Pookampam Adhikamaakudhe		- Enadhu

7. Sooriyan Irulaaki Sandhiran Raththa Maachchudhe;
  Jodhi Natchaththirangal Aththikkaai Pol Udhirndhadhe			- Enadhu

